]","noteId":"footnote-11211-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"杜丽娘出生于官宦家庭，从小受封建家长的管束和封建礼教的压抑。她受到《诗经·关雎》的触动，青春意识开始觉醒。于是违背父母、塾师训诫，走出深闺，偷偷前往后花园游赏。盛开的百花，绚烂的色彩，开启了她的心扉。这段曲词细腻生动地描摹了一个少女青春萌动时的微妙心理，情真意切。诵读时注意把握主人公的情绪流转，体会作者融情于景的写法。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《牡丹亭》（《汤显祖戏曲集》，上海古籍出版社 1978 年版）。题目是编者加的。汤显祖（1550—1616），字义仍，号若士，临川（今江西抚州）人，明代戏曲作家。代表作有传奇《紫钗记》《牡丹亭》《南柯记》《邯郸记》，合称“玉茗堂（汤显祖居所名）四梦”或“临川四梦”。《牡丹亭》全剧共五十五出，描写了南安太守杜宝的女儿杜丽娘与书生柳梦梅的爱情故事。这段曲词出自第十出《惊梦》。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11211-4","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-11211-h-1","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-11211-h-1","text":"#p-11211-h-1","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-1","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-2","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-3","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-4","postId":"11211-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11211-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https:/